  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "A comprehensive rubric for evaluating software engineers across technical, collaborative, delivery, and growth dimensions. Designed to provide objective, behavior-based assessments.",
  "rating_scale": {
    "5_Exceeds_Expectations": "Consistently performs above the standard. Drives innovation, mentors others, and delivers significant business impact. Sets the benchmark for the team.",
