            "3": "Occasionally misses deadlines or underestimates effort. Needs reminders or help with prioritization.",
            "2": "Frequently misses deadlines. Poor time management or task estimation.",
            "1": "Rarely delivers work on time. Blocks team progress or project milestones."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Business Value & Ownership",
          "descriptors": {
            "5": "Deeply understands business goals. Takes ownership of outcomes, not just tasks. Drives initiatives that add significant value beyond the ticket.",
            "4": "Understands requirements and delivers value. Takes ownership of assigned features and sees them through to production.",
            "3": "Focuses on tasks rather than outcomes. May need direction on priorities or business context.",
            "2": "Lacks understanding of business context. Delivers work that misses the mark or requires rework.",
            "1": "Work has little to no business value. Resists ownership or accountability."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "growth",
      "name": "Growth & Mentorship",
      "weight": 0.10,
      "description": "Assesses learning agility, adaptability, and contribution to others' development.",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "name": "Learning & Adaptability",
          "descriptors": {
            "5": "Actively learns new technologies and shares knowledge. Adapts quickly to change. Seeks feedback and implements it rapidly.",
            "4": "Open to feedback and learns as needed. Keeps skills current. Adapts to new tools or processes.",
            "3": "Receptive to feedback but slow to apply. Learning is reactive rather than proactive.",
            "2": "Resistant to feedback. Stagnant skill set. Struggles to adapt to changes.",
            "1": "Defensive to feedback. Refuses to learn or adapt. Hinders team evolution."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mentorship & Knowledge Sharing",
          "descriptors": {
            "5": "Actively mentors junior engineers. Shares knowledge through talks, docs, or pair programming. Elevates the team's overall capability.",
            "4": "Willing to help others. Shares knowledge when asked. Contributes to team learning.",
            "3": "Helps occasionally but does not proactively mentor. Knowledge sharing is inconsistent.",
            "2": "Reluctant to share knowledge. Hoards information or is unavailable to help.",
            "1": "Undermines others. Negative influence on team growth. Withholds critical information."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "usage_guidelines": {
    "calibration": "Reviewers should calibrate ratings against the rating scale definitions before scoring to ensure consistency.",
